    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'lekana kwamwa Abulamu na Loto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Abulamu waku'fumaga ku' nsi' ya Misili na wasu'v'aga ku' ibalangu' lya Negebu haki'mo na muki' wakwe na vintu' vyav'o vyose i'vyo v'av'age navyo, hangi' Loto wayaga nav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha itungo lyeni'lo Abulamu wasangwa musav'i muno wa mitugo, na mawe ga mupango ga feza na zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'fuma kwenu'ko ku' Negebu Abulamu wawu'kaga musi'nzo ku'ya ku' mbele mpaka wafikaga ku' kaya ya Beteli, u'ko wav'age atu'u'lile nkambi' yakwe ha mbu'ki', hagati' na kaya ya Beteli na Ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henanho hu' hene wav'age azyengile ihozezyo ku'fuma ha mbu'ki', na henanho Abulamu wamwisengaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' lina lyakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Loto u'yo wawu'kaga musi'nzo haki'mo na Abulamu, wav'age na madale ga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li, haki'mo na mahema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno ya wingi wa mitugo zyav'o, lwandi' lwenu'lo lwalekaga ku'v'agelani'la kwikala haki'mo v'ose v'av'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo lyawu'kaga isola mugati' na v'adi'mi v'a mitugo zyamwa Abulamu na zyamwa Loto. Hangi' mu itungo lyeni'lo V'akanaani na V'apelizi v'av'age v'ikazi v'a mwenu'mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Abulamu wamuwi'laga Loto, “Ku'du' ku'v'e na isola mugati' yanne nanho, ninga ku' v'adi'mi v'iswe, ku'nguno iswe ku'li' v'a wu'du'gu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lolaga lwandi' lose lwenu'lu'. Ku'lekane. U'lu' ev'e u'ku'londa ku' mumoso ene nku'londa ku' mulyi'la, na u'lu' u'ku'londa ku' mulyi'la ene nku'londa ku' mumoso.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Loto wawu'syaga minso gakwe, na ku'wona iwonde lya mongo gwa Yolodani i'vi li'li' na minzi' mingi. Ku'ya mpaka kaya ya Soali wawonaga ati' li'li' na wu'soga wa minzi' mingi ki'ti' mugu'nda gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na ki'ti' nsi' ya Misili. Yeni'yi' yav'age aho Gu'ku' wav'age akaali' ku'zizimangu'zya kaya zya Sodoma na Gomola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo Loto wisogolelaga iwonde lya mongo gwa Yolodani, na walondaga kwenu'ko ku' lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya. Hu' vyene yav'aga ku'lekana kwav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulamu wasigalaga mu lwandi' lwa Kanaani, sumbwa Loto wayaga ku'kikala ku' kaya zya iwonde lyeni'lo, na wazyengaga nkambi' yakwe bi'hi' na Sodoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi v'antu' v'a kaya ya Sodoma v'av'age v'akenagu'zi muno ha mbele na minso gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu ali'mulagana Abulamu ku'mupa nsi'",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga aho Loto wawu'kaga, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Abulamu ati', “Ku'fumi'i'la henanho u'li' wu'syaga minso gako u'lole ki'la lwandi', ki'ya na mweli, sukuma na dakama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsi' yose yeni'yi' u'yi'wine nku'ku'pa ev'e na wu'v'yalwa wako yi'v'e yinywe nhananhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wu'v'yalwa wako nku'wu'v'ezya wu'v'e wingi ki'ti' lu'wuwu lwa nsi', ki'ti' i'vi muntu' akakowola ku'lu'solozya hu' vyene wu'v'yalwa wako ku'du'hu' u'yo alakowole ku'wu'solozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi'si' wu'ka u'yi'yu'mbi'le nsi' yeni'yi' ku' wu'gali'nhu wayo na wu'lihu wayo, nguno nku'ku'pa ev'e.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Abulamu wasamyaga mahema gakwe, na wayaga ku'kikala ku' kaya ya Hebuloni bi'hi' na miti' mihanya zyamwa Mamule, na kwenu'ko wamuzyengelaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ihozezyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
